/--
Decoder-level no-direct mathematical core over the independent static header.

This is the theorem-facing shape closest to the intended finite-memory proof:
the hard inputs are the represented truth-state package, the split quotient, a
truth decoder for current receipt/order data on append histories, and a
truth-factorization of the chosen parity progress.  Lean constructs the
receipt/order append package and the truth-level parity bridge from these
fields.
-/
