  parity_factor :
    ∀ h : History In₁ In₂ Graph Out₁ Out₂,
      header.parityOfHistory h =
        parityOfTruth
          (regularTestTruthVector (stabilizedSaturationBasis header.cert)
            (pathOfHistoryByRound header.edgeOfRound h))

/--
Raw-factor representative-decoder core over the independent static header.

This is one step below the split-quotient interface: instead of taking a
