mathematical obligation.  It keeps bounded generated representatives only as
representatives of stabilized truth atoms; it does not require every history
to literally be generated by the fixed strategy.  The raw no-direct epoch
state and current receipt/order payload are instead required to factor
directly through the actual stabilized truth atom.
