/-!
The following converter is the checked receipt/order part of the last-block
proof.  Once the finite-memory argument supplies a unary decoder from
stabilized truth atoms to the current receipt/order data, append-level
determinacy is no longer an independent mathematical obligation: it is just two
applications of the decoder equation.
