/--
Paper-facing restricted canonical-data certificate with semantic backend.

This exposes the represented-truth payload as its four standard data packages:
bounded represented truth states, raw/automaton truth-vector separation,
receipt/order append data, and truth-level parity bridge.  Lean converts this
data package to the canonical represented-truth payload used by the quotient
endpoint.
